      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat does not use Windows Media Player.\nHowever, it does use WMF, or Windows Media Foundations. This is a modern, up to date framework used to play media in many applications. It is a sub-dependency of our video playback methods.\nWe have no plans to replace it at this time.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
