      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: \nThank you for the reply!\nI must've gotten some information mixed up, either way i now know that what I'm looking for isn't WMP, but rather WMF\nthanks for the info!\ni think there is actually a workaround avaliable for WMF for use with Wine/Proton which i might be able to use, if it works i might open up a pull request to https://github.com/valveSoftware/Proton to include that workaround to, finally fix the last major issue there was with running the game on non-windows systems\nHave a nice day!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
