      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have thought about this a bit, and realised that there might be a way simpler solution than to entirely replace WMF\nthat being having some sort of fallback which could handle media without WMF, or alternatively support for Wine's implementation of WMF",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
